Bookings tab work for every guest.
Each account is tied to a unique identifier so a logged-in guest sees only their own
bookings.
The email verification OTP on sign-up (already built) applies to Journey B.
Do not force a login before booking. The guest reaches the choice screen only after
entering their booking details.
